{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "8cab86c6b13b8423f52fb1068b2f6e3ba6b64b94aea9aa5ee58b74c28efc2b5a", "ja": "わっさー？　茜ちゃん", "zh": "怎么啦？　小茜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3df41ab9cc30bc65d37ecf45f267386ca3f39d43a38e98cdb42797d273c30660", "ja": "律子と海美も加わり、迎えたレッスン初日。\nやる気を見せる環、星梨花だが、茜はひとり\n遅刻してしまい、律子に怒られる。仕事につ\nいて考えていて、つい夜更かししてしまった\nとの事。やる気がないわけではなさそうだ。", "zh": "律子和海美也加入了进来，迎来了第一天的课程。\n虽然环和星梨花干劲十足，但茜却独自一人\n迟到了，结果被律子训了一顿。据说是因为\n一直在考虑工作的事，不知不觉就熬夜了。\n看来并不是没有干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e5493a6bf26b11bbc5415ce836bce12d9dd0a2f0f974ecabe27f401f5dbb8b2b", "ja": "（いよいよ『アリエス』が始動！　律子と海美も\nレッスンに加わり、今日が初日なんだけど……）", "zh": "（终于《白羊座》要开始了！律子和海美也加入了训练，今天是第一天，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "c358bb3be0bb79949893c6cb31ebb3bb80ee13a0f305f41d8f327ba16b7a947a", "ja": "{$P$}、茜から連絡ありました？\n初日から遅刻なんて、いい度胸ですよね、まったく。", "zh": "{$P$}，收到茜的联系了吗？\n第一天就迟到，胆子可真不小，真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0148b53b56156e77efe3d96f471b2fdce592535c816da1b3bd750e94d1fe3cb2", "ja": "いや、朝に遅刻の連絡があったっきりだ。\n特に理由の説明もなくてな……。", "zh": "不是，早上联系说迟到了之后，就再没消息了。\n也没特别说明理由……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "34ab620ed18987f5a3acde267309de22b3408818ea3f891c9241068855595fcd", "ja": "とりあえず、先にレッスン始めとく？\n予約の時間もあるし、ウズウズしてきちゃったよー！", "zh": "总之，要不要先开始训练？\n毕竟还约好了时间，我已经等不及啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "f1bd4a58650f5e45a3f13ab221fb8456be4c34e1c94e1ba506e7d999fb577984", "ja": "そうしようよ！　たまきもウズウズしてきたっ！\nりつことせりかも、早く早く！", "zh": "就这么办吧！环也开始坐不住了！\n律子、星梨花，你们也快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "89fff0754e05adc213c9d085a6068de6bc816150ce28587ee8220c4d1e9b8eee", "ja": "そうそう、いい感じ！\nまずリズムを覚えると、すんなりできるでしょ？", "zh": "对对，就是这种感觉！\n先把节奏记住，就能顺利做到了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "6f600472a73074a8ee7d2afa85b2b1c3638b1abfe173441e682d1afcab335d9f", "ja": "本当ですね！　律子さんのアドバイス、\nすごくわかりやすくて、勉強になります。", "zh": "真的呢！律子小姐的建议特别容易理解，让我学到了很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8aa9c799d66f6481b843ad0823bd2462d41d600c24fa564460cf6c1514c94e8c", "ja": "さすがだな、律子。『ARMooo』での\n経験が、しっかり活きてるじゃないか。", "zh": "真不愧是你啊，律子。《ARMooo》的经验发挥得很充分嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "d39582ba3ea2fd1214eda74f65bb8d4fba249fe12edea9b2c960e4f29022b7f7", "ja": "いえ、私は大したことしてませんって。\nみんなの飲み込みが早いんですよ。", "zh": "不，我也没做什么了不起的事。是大家理解得很快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "4584b59551158b2f9b3fb4548b9cf691738bec8f764f0d59b4f3f6b0f60ce67d", "ja": "ねえねえ、りつこ。ふりーすたいるぱーと？\nって、たまきが好きに歌ってもいいんだよね？", "zh": "那个那个，律子。自由发挥部分？就是说，环想怎么唱都可以，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "ca787d41e0e11d7948f5d0ef3df3a6c8250f18b494f0c4b11475d9810b016917", "ja": "ええ、そうよ。\nリズムに合わせて、自分の気持ちを伝えるの。", "zh": "嗯，是的。\n配合节奏，把自己的心情传达出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "34acc8604d81823982b1db94f01571ee804f03f9171071b93cb2172c45e27c9a", "ja": "たまきね、今すっごく楽しいんだけど、\nそれってどうやったら伝わるかな～？", "zh": "环，很开心，可是这种心情要怎样才能传达出去呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "3a958206a80523b84bafaea745e17eae27de098bf285e7bdbb82b828a2f011d1", "ja": "ん～……もともと楽しい歌だから、\nそのまま自然な流れで大丈夫な気がするけど……。", "zh": "嗯……本来就是一首欢快的歌，我觉得顺其自然地唱出来就可以了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "4b77512e87e20223af2886ed13cb571561745da0d4c87719f9ce788a1024f16b", "ja": "だったら、一緒にどうするか考えよっか？\n環の思ってること、言葉にしてみようよ！", "zh": "既然这样，要不要一起想想该怎么做？\n把环心里所想的事情，用语言表达出来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "3e337f764a6b8f92a0f550d98c6a0de28e17f2526248083462eff30333c29541", "ja": "ほんと！？　\nくふふ♪　ありがと、うみみ！", "zh": "真的！？  \n嘿嘿♪ 谢谢你，海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "e70069ef89e3c5f98b45603156d026b6dcad04dc8b4b2f03b8bb7134c4eb3763", "ja": "わたしは、もう少しラップの練習がしたいので……\n律子さん、お手伝いしてもらっていいですか？", "zh": "我还想再练一会儿说唱……\n律子小姐，能麻烦您指导我一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "a184c6af9717910e611d14c16dbceae300d02113aaf97b37ca59b100be08eef1", "ja": "もちろんいいわよ。実践しながらやりましょう。\nイェー、イェー……アーハン？　チェケラ！", "zh": "当然可以呀。一边实战一边练习吧。\n耶，耶……啊哈？　Check it out！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6f53fb1d5459ec111089a9a745f7cb6f1598b7c2ce965a23d12b597d0f0512ec", "ja": "おーい、みんな！　そろそろ休憩にしないか？\nぶっ続けだとよくないし。", "zh": "喂——大家！差不多该休息一下了吧？\n一直这样不停练下去可不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "a69339d6cdaad08c66edfa2e71967ec768570fd1778b93d85d8ca49bbbdea5ac", "ja": "くふふ♪　ありがとうおやぶん。\nみんなでレッスンすると、楽しくてあっという間だね！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　谢谢你，老大。  \n大家一起练习，开心得时间一下子就过去了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "8eb6ff8241373203a11f8e64e1a6a95c6bc11242985523c178daa3ffa6db72dc", "ja": "そうね。みんなにつられて、\n私も飛ばしすぎちゃったわ。ちょっと休憩……。", "zh": "是啊。被大家带动着，我也练得太猛了。稍微休息一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "eb1ad73985e596acc82b360c213e7001a6ead5ec807c0829ca37e6a79a322abc", "ja": "えへへ。わたしもやりすぎちゃいました。\nサプライズライブもありますから、つい……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，我也有点做过头了。因为还有惊喜演出，一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "ac32bf23b9ba4f055f7ececbbafa2d6a3c8670f5abb2f6b1cdfcd25cb7c82d2f", "ja": "あ、それそれ！　せりりんたち、卒業式で\nサプライズするんだって？　すごいよねっ！", "zh": "啊，对对！听说星梨花她们要在毕业典礼上给人惊喜？真厉害呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "4c441240a922719ac102c792aff5576aecec617e553e4eb43b6422d34f2c5911", "ja": "私、自分の卒業式でそんなことしてもらったら、\nもうすっごく嬉しくなっちゃう☆", "zh": "要是我自己的毕业典礼上有人给我来这么一出，\n我肯定会超级开心的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "bbcd7a575f9e532ce265f5b4e9be83cf753dc77bd4eb0a029dc602a194e5a4f3", "ja": "確かにそれは、一生の思い出になりそうね。", "zh": "确实，那好像会成为一生难忘的回忆呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "1dddce2c66d1f19ffaf673565d3b091825bb92a687bbb952d10bcfa40b0d6136", "ja": "はいっ、そうなるように、がんばりたいです！\n生徒のみなさんにとって、本当に大切な日だから。", "zh": "好的！我想努力让那一天成为这样一段回忆！\n因为对各位学生来说，那是真正重要的日子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1026_040tam", "source_sha256": "005fe15bab02ac7cb62cbf14b7ad37d5d26d70b9c3924d3c9bc4dbb60f922502", "ja": "たまきも、絶対楽しくするって約束したんだ！\nだから、もっともっと頑張れるぞ～。", "zh": "环也保证过，一定会让大家开心的！\n所以，我还可以更加更加努力哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "552b15ed1820e392741b77ee4a48c429e74f65ee7b05720d09289e1a2815082c", "ja": "ふたりとも、すごいやる気ね！　ふふっ。\n私たちも、できる限り協力するわ。ね、海美？", "zh": "你们两个干劲真足啊！呵呵。\n我们也会尽可能帮忙的。对吧，海美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "b7f89686595a8a764ebd78b39ce5dfd46c5c8b111752000c5e08bd6b808d7316", "ja": "うんうん！　何かあったら気軽に相談して。\nうみみん☆サポート、しちゃうから！", "zh": "嗯嗯！有什么事就尽管来找我商量吧。\n海美☆支援，就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "422b4683cea04588088ac28d9b7cf499bf128a0f437bd7396b05b0d9613a04ba", "ja": "ありがとう、ふたりとも。\n公演もあって忙しいし、何かと頼りにさせてもらうよ。", "zh": "谢谢你们两位。\n公演在即大家都很忙，到时候免不了要多依仗你们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "d7b10c6b5dbfcf9b5891ca6aec9a7494f5563eea45df1baaee45412bcbfeafe2", "ja": "よーし、それじゃあみんなで、\n最高のサプライズライブにしちゃうゾ♪　おーっ！", "zh": "好～，那么大家一起，\n办一场最棒的惊喜演出吧♪　喔——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "f7555b99d68c342beccbfd6472c7822b599065beef0d41da3b70e0abe808e9fa", "ja": "おーっ♪　……って、あ、あれ、茜さん！？", "zh": "哦——♪……等等，咦，茜姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1032_p", "source_sha256": "4d1c2bcf71b06621934bcc111c73856aadba1406bcc14fdf591306e284eed117", "ja": "っと、いつの間に……？", "zh": "咦，什么时候来的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1033_023aka", "source_sha256": "a9e6a990de66148b6cf893ea8fe9fd4fbce1736b045716b54a6e72f1d64da72c", "ja": "ちょっと前からいたよ。茜ちゃん、空気読める系\n女子だからネ！　タイミングを見計らっていたのだよ。", "zh": "我已经来了一会儿了。小茜，我可是很会看气氛的女生！一直在等合适的时机呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "10dc6d6ea4a7d255a2446cbd241f42913756b8a9484567b9f0b248bcc5e275f3", "ja": "みんなの話を聞いて、茜ちゃんもやる気MAX！\nさっそく休憩を切り上げて、レッスン再開、いくゾ～！", "zh": "听了大家的话，小茜也干劲MAX啦！\n赶紧结束休息，重新开始练习，出发咯～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1035_009rit", "source_sha256": "1727a2eed2951a46d11fb3076b7780be5d6e43b085ed4f0b50609c100ad2fb99", "ja": "こら、茜！　その前に、遅刻の理由くらい\nちゃんと説明しなさい。心配するでしょ。", "zh": "喂，茜！在那之前，至少把迟到的理由好好说明一下。会让人担心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1036_023aka", "source_sha256": "6c6cb1f2c369c5742a49a59250c46063eba347310d80c66b9cb2cd4b28d3c36b", "ja": "ニャ、ニャハ☆　それは、ええと……。\n茜ちゃん、ちょっと気になることがあってネ……。", "zh": "喵、喵哈☆　那个，怎么说呢……  \n小茜，因为有件事让我有点在意喵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1037_023aka", "source_sha256": "b90119058b01d6bf4580a189253aff7f999a773233e1ac706cebdfa354f39061", "ja": "ずーっと考えてたら、つい夜更かししちゃって、\nその……目覚ましは掛けたんだけどニャー。", "zh": "一直想个不停，不知不觉就熬夜了，\n那个……虽然设了闹钟，可还是……喵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1038_009rit", "source_sha256": "c2eaa1db1ab77b348d4be6c93d83e6f3aac7abf30592997fbde2a07779aec758", "ja": "何よそれ、結局ただの寝坊ってこと？\nあ・か・ね～……！", "zh": "那算什么啊，说到底不就是睡过头了吗？\n茜——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1039_023aka", "source_sha256": "4c75d9147d072abb43bea10b6cbfd2937d4399061fe3fcc8f9507f2198d847d1", "ja": "あっ、そうだ、茜ちゃん、準備運動まだだった！\n走り込み、行ってきまーすっ！　シュバッ！", "zh": "啊，对了，小茜，还没做热身运动呢！我去跑步啦——！咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1040_009rit", "source_sha256": "b556bc36384ee4d6c8913eaeb00e4e544f675154c009bbeb01364f60f25a0117", "ja": "あ～ら、だったら私も付き合ってあげるわよ？\nこらーっ、待ちなさい、茜～っ！", "zh": "哎～呀，那我也来陪陪你吧？\n喂——，给我站住，茜——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_03_1041_p", "source_sha256": "b641a97f359405d7dc7e43652a76e0edff0aa2e1b028e32051cadad0e65601ee", "ja": "（まあ、茜もやる気はあるみたいだし、きつく言う\n必要はないかな……よし、レッスンを続けよう！）", "zh": "（不过，茜好像也挺有干劲的，没必要说得太严厉吧……好，继续上课！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
